      "curator_note": "Same gamma-H rearrangement to the distonic ion 6.2 as in record IMS8-EQ8.2d (shared precursor step for both McLafferty branches). Book draws 0 electron-pushing arcs: Eq. 8.2 is a thermochemical fragmentation map (log k printed above each reaction arrow, heats of formation printed below each species), not a curved-arrow figure. All electron moves here are curator-inferred from the mechanism-type label printed under the reaction arrow; none is drawn on the page. Three fishhooks: O6 odd electron -> forming O6-H8 bond; one C2-H8 electron -> O6-H8 bond; the other C2-H8 electron -> C2 (new gamma radical). H8 written [1H] to stay an atom-mapped node."
